      "final_text": "I wrote and landed the library part of T1. The CLI, HTTP API and README are not done, and I haven't checked whether the other agents have started on them.\n\nThe push linked as seq 2. It adds `todolib.py`, `tests/test_todolib.py` and `docs/library.md`. `python -m pytest -q` passed on my working copy (5 tests, all library tests) before I pushed.\n\n**Library API**\n- **Functions:** `add_todo`, `list_todos`, `get_todo`, `update_todo`, `mark_done`, `add_tags`, `remove_todo`. Each takes an optional `path=` keyword, and the default store file comes from `TODO_FILE`, else `todos.json`.\n- **Errors:** `NotFoundError` (message exactly `no todo with id 7`) and `ValidationError`, both subclasses of `TodoError`. The CLI should exit 1 for the first and 2 for the second.\n\nI posted this API on T1 and suggested a split:\n- **@a2:** `cli.py`, its tests and `docs/cli.md`.\n- **@a3:** `api.py`, its tests and `docs/http.md`.\n- **@a4:** `README.md` linking the docs.\n\nI haven't looked at the inbox since pushing, so I can't say whether anyone is waiting on a review from me.",
