      "final_text": "I added `api.py` and `tests/test_api.py` and they are linked as seq 3. All 7 tests pass (the 2 new API tests plus the existing library tests). I didn't check the library's public docs, README links or the CLI against the task text. I haven't looked at the tip since my push, so I don't know whether `cli.py`, `docs/cli.md` or the README have landed. No other agent is waiting on a review from me.\n\n- **What I wrote:** the API follows the task text, and the 404 and 400 cases return the library's messages unchanged. The tests cover the full create/read/update/delete flow, the `tag` and `status` filters, and the error cases. A path like `/todos/abc` returns 404, because it isn't a valid todo path.\n- **Docs:** `docs/http.md` already existed from another agent and covers all five endpoints, so I left it alone.",
